1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,993
What if everything around
you could become 3D?

2
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,810
Point at it, and it's rebuilt.

3
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,892
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR.

4
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,346
Let's go into the village, in VR.

5
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,051
We analyse the view.

6
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,852
We take the fridge.

7
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,778
The AI draws its views…

8
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:11,099
…and here it is, in 3D.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,989
Now, let's go outside.

10
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,591
We analyse the street.

11
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:30,411
We take the car.

12
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,877
There it is, in 3D.

13
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,582
Into the village simulation.

14
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,165
Same headset, no loading.

15
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,372
Here's the village.

16
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,839
And here's a map, to find our way.

17
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,632
Fast forward to the evening.

18
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:16,296
I cut the power to the houses…

19
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,589
…the lights fade.

20
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,189
And back on.

21
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,095
The dispatcher's mixing desk.

22
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,182
The clinic? Never cut.

23
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,820
Back to the lab.

24
00:02:42,100 --> 00:02:46,730
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the
world. Build it. Power it.
